humans endured under the right conditions. It was an enormous foodrich frontier. The cold created terrible

13
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:42,000
costs. But it also concentrated some of the largest moving packages of meat, fat, hide, bone, and ivory on Earth.

14
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Humans did not simply survive the North.

15
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:51,000
They discovered how to make the North profitable. The story began long before modern humans reached the Arctic.

16
00:01:51,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Members of the genus Homo left Africa roughly 2 million years ago. Over immense stretches of time, population spread across Eurasia and encountered

17
