00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Northern settlement happened in pulses.

25
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Climate shifted constantly during the pleaene. Ice sheets expanded and retreated. Temperatures changed.

26
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Rainfall patterns moved, forests advanced, then broke apart. A region that was barely habitable during one

27
