29
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:44,000
a cold, dry ecosystem, often called the Mammoth Step. It stretched across much of Eurasia and when sea levels were low through Beringia into North America.

30
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:55,000
This landscape looked less like modern swampy tundra and more like open grassland mixed with herbs and low shrubs. It was cold, windy, and spectacularly unpleasant to sleep in.

31
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:04,000
