44
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:42,000
protein. The liver can process only so much nitrogen from protein breakdown.

45
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:51,000
People eating mostly lean animals can become ill even while consuming large quantities of meat, a condition sometimes called protein poisoning or rabbit starvation.

46
00:05:51,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Fat was the true northern currency. It supplied dense energy, helped the body meet the high metabolic cost of cold, and made large prey far more valuable

