72
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:40,000
Snow movement, moisture, and sharp vegetation damaged seams. Cold weather survival was not achieved once. It was stitched back together every day.

73
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Shelter presented the same problem at a larger scale. Caves are useful, but inconveniently refuse to appear wherever

74
