insulated with hides and warmed by bodies or fire can be dramatically warmer than the open step. The first

80
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:44,000
northern homes were not attempts to heat Siberia. They reduced Siberia to one room. Fire remained essential, but it

81
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:52,000
created another puzzle. What do people burn above the tree line? The Arctic was not always completely treeless and

