00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:47,000
into darkness, and discouraged some predators.

89
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:56,000
It also created a social center where information could be exchanged. That last function may have been as valuable as the heat. No individual could master

90
00:11:56,000 --> 00:12:03,000
the northern world alone. One person knew a river crossing. Another could read tracks. Another repaired weapons.

91
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:08,000
Another remembered where fuel remained after a storm. Children required care.

92
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:18,000
Injured hunters required food. Large carcasses required rapid processing before scavengers arrived or weather changed. Cooperation distributed risk.

93
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:25,000
If every hunter ate only what they personally killed, one failed day could be fatal. Sharing allowed the group to

94
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:33,000
